{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>孟加拉有度假村發生火災，至少10人罹難。</p><p></p><p>現場火光熊熊，冒出大量濃煙。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BAND.FIRE-0400.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zH6nqE1IAd1792273055.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在孟加拉灣附近，當地一個海濱度假村當地周六早上7時許起火。由於建築物以木材及易燃物料搭建，導致火勢迅速蔓延，加上部分住客熟睡，未能及時逃離現場，部分死者是婦女及兒童。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BAND.FIRE-0400_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261tPvydanss1792273051.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>消防局指涉事度假村未獲消防安全許可證，當局早在6月發出安全警告。當局成立專責委員會，調查起火原因。 </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T22:18:51.949123+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T00:57:36.242327+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T22:17:35.572435+00:00","content_hash":"eccec58e2cf24ba31bc2b9fc9f1f480819a6bcf6e6631ca953bb4057f4b4f2f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}